<title>FINLAND: TALENTUM PROPOSES 1.40 MARKKA '96 DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>TALENTUM PROPOSES 1.40 MARKKA '96 DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    1.40 vs 2.00</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinary items,</p>
<p>  reserves, tax				    31.5 vs 23.2</p>
<p> Net sales					  152.0 vs 137.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish media group is Talentum Oy.</p>
<p>Talentum on January 30 released preliminary 1996 results.</p>
